Z||000004||camon||11-15-2001||01:23 PM||||You might also try this!<P>(This is assuming everything is still stock)<P>Under your hood (front hood)on driverside wheel well there is a tag (hopefully yours is still there) It has a bunch of codes on it (numbers and letters). This shows you what the manufacture put in your perticular car.<BR>Write down the codes and then goto:<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/options.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/options.html</A> <P>Now just match your codes to the ones this site has listed and they will tell you what you got!  Everything from the stereo that was put in at factory to the transmission to the final drive ratio!<p>[This message has been edited by camon (edited 11-15-2001).]||||reg||3
